WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.400
The shining time...

00:08.570 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.080 --> 00:30.210
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.300 --> 00:38.600
I can sense it.

00:39.760 --> 00:46.900
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.150 --> 00:54.820
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.830
You've run so far.

01:02.910 --> 01:10.090
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.290 --> 01:16.300
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.600
my stolen heart beats.

01:43.410 --> 01:46.120
Maron, what are you doing?

01:46.120 --> 01:49.080
120 degrees, 120 degrees...

01:49.080 --> 01:52.210
Must keep it like this, with more style and balance.

01:52.210 --> 01:53.420
Maron!

01:55.420 --> 01:57.050
Geez, will you be quiet?

01:57.050 --> 02:00.010
I have to practice for the upcoming gymnastics tournament!

02:00.010 --> 02:02.470
I was practicing a beautiful pose...

02:02.470 --> 02:03.850
That wasn't beautiful!

02:05.180 --> 02:07.520
What was that?!

02:07.520 --> 02:08.390
Coming!

02:10.310 --> 02:12.980
I'll eat bad children!

02:12.980 --> 02:14.820
What?!

02:16.240 --> 02:18.200
It's nice, isn't it?

02:18.200 --> 02:21.160
Wow, that's so cute!

02:21.160 --> 02:27.410
We're going to do the play "Little Red Riding Hood" for the kindergarten classes in the district.

02:27.410 --> 02:29.040
You're going to help out, too.

02:29.040 --> 02:30.380
I am?

02:30.380 --> 02:32.920
It's for the spring traffic safety campaigns.

02:32.920 --> 02:35.960
My dad wants you to participate in it.

02:35.960 --> 02:38.300
I don't know if I'll be able to do it...

02:38.300 --> 02:41.510
You have to since I wrote a part for you in the script.

02:41.510 --> 02:42.800
You wrote it?

02:42.800 --> 02:45.260
Yeah, it's really good!

02:45.260 --> 02:47.850
I want to play Little Red Riding Hood!

02:47.850 --> 02:50.270
No, no. I'm doing that part.

02:50.270 --> 02:54.190
You're going to be the grandma that gets eaten by the wolf.

02:54.980 --> 02:57.400
No fair! Then who's going to be the wolf?

02:57.400 --> 03:00.150
Class President, of course.

03:00.150 --> 03:03.910
It's not like you to not invite Chiaki to do it.

03:03.910 --> 03:05.950
I already did.

03:05.950 --> 03:08.250
But there aren't any parts for him to do.

03:11.710 --> 03:18.380
First Kiss under the Shining Moonlight!

03:22.390 --> 03:24.850
The part of the prince is left.

03:24.850 --> 03:27.520
Chiaki is going to be the handsome prince.

03:27.520 --> 03:31.640
There's no prince in "Little Red Riding Hood" though...

03:31.640 --> 03:33.100
There is in my play.

03:34.020 --> 03:39.030
Little Red Riding Hood gets attacked by the wolf that ate her grandma....

03:39.030 --> 03:41.860
...and receives a cut from the wolf.

03:44.820 --> 03:47.120
Then she falls into an eternal sleep.

03:47.120 --> 03:51.410
Just as the wolf is about to eat her, the prince appears.

03:53.330 --> 03:58.300
He then kisses Little Red Riding Hood, who has fallen into an eternal sleep.

03:58.300 --> 04:03.300
She is awakened by the kiss, both of them fall in love,

04:03.300 --> 04:05.680
marry and live happily ever after!

04:05.680 --> 04:07.180
That's a weird story.

04:07.180 --> 04:10.890
It's a beautiful story, thanks to my imagination.

04:10.890 --> 04:13.850
You got the ending straight from "Snow White..."

04:13.850 --> 04:16.810
You'll do the part of the prince, won't you, Chiaki?

04:16.810 --> 04:17.980
It's okay with me.

04:17.980 --> 04:20.650
All right! We'll practice at my place!

04:20.650 --> 04:25.700
We'll have to go through the final act, which has the kissing scene.

04:25.700 --> 04:27.490
Kissing, huh?

04:27.490 --> 04:30.580
It's nice if love blooms with a kiss.

04:30.580 --> 04:32.410
It's every girl's dream!

04:32.410 --> 04:34.790
It can be a guy's dream, too.

04:34.790 --> 04:38.210
Hey, what are you thinking?!

04:38.210 --> 04:39.840
Aren't we playing in front of kindergarteners?

04:39.840 --> 04:42.420
Love is a mysterious and holy thing.

04:42.420 --> 04:45.840
We're just going to teach the children so it's okay.

04:59.690 --> 05:01.400
It's from Chiaki.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.440
You seem pleased, Maron.

05:03.440 --> 05:07.110
Of course I'm not! What does Chiaki want anyway?

05:07.870 --> 05:11.950
<i>"Give it up! Are you going to wait for the letter until you're an old lady?"</i>

05:12.500 --> 05:14.370
I hate that guy!

05:14.370 --> 05:16.170
But you look kinda happy.

05:16.580 --> 05:18.330
I was not!

05:19.380 --> 05:21.380
<i>Well, maybe just a little...</i>

05:22.050 --> 05:24.670
P.S... What the... Au gratin...?

05:26.760 --> 05:27.470
I want to eat some!

05:28.760 --> 05:30.300
Get off me!

05:30.300 --> 05:34.270
I haven't eaten in a while. Make me some au gratin.

05:34.270 --> 05:36.690
Why don't you ask you-know-who behind you?

05:38.310 --> 05:39.770
I'll make you some--

05:39.770 --> 05:41.230
No, I will!

05:45.070 --> 05:47.280
The light is red.

05:47.280 --> 05:50.780
We can't cross because there are cars coming.

05:50.780 --> 05:52.200
Okay!

05:52.200 --> 05:54.080
The light is green now.

05:54.080 --> 05:58.460
Let's look left, then right, then left again and cross the street with our arms raised.

06:01.130 --> 06:03.090
Well done.

06:06.300 --> 06:09.300
Hey, wait up!

06:09.800 --> 06:11.720
Keiichi-kun, stop!

06:11.720 --> 06:13.720
- Wait for me!

06:12.470 --> 06:13.720
- Don't hurt others!

06:15.520 --> 06:17.100
Ouch!!

06:18.100 --> 06:19.440
What is it?!

06:20.940 --> 06:22.440
Stupid!

06:24.650 --> 06:28.400
What a stubborn kid!

06:31.410 --> 06:34.200
Grandmother, how are you feeling?

06:34.200 --> 06:35.910
That's not Grandmother!

06:35.910 --> 06:37.450
Run away!

06:37.450 --> 06:38.500
It's the wolf!

06:38.500 --> 06:43.630
Come closer and show me your pretty face...

06:43.630 --> 06:46.840
Grandmother, why is your mouth so wide?

06:47.970 --> 06:50.840
The better...to eat you!!

06:56.020 --> 06:58.640
I'm not scared of the wolf!

07:05.230 --> 07:11.990
I am very sorry for what happened today and for allowing him to ruin the play.

07:11.990 --> 07:15.410
Well, boys tend to be rambunctious.

07:15.410 --> 07:18.330
Keiichi-kun is usually a very nice little boy.

07:18.330 --> 07:21.870
But he started acting up about a week ago...

07:21.870 --> 07:28.300
We're concerned that he and his parents may be having trouble...

07:32.760 --> 07:36.350
I'm worn out after making those dolls.

07:36.350 --> 07:39.680
But they asked us to do it again!

07:39.680 --> 07:43.600
Um, my tutor is about to come...

07:43.600 --> 07:44.770
Huh?

07:44.770 --> 07:48.650
Sorry, I have to go home now. See you tomorrow!

07:58.660 --> 08:02.580
I wanted to do the kissing scene with the prince.

08:02.580 --> 08:06.210
Aren't you getting the prince and Chiaki mixed up?

08:06.210 --> 08:07.460
I guess so.

08:08.340 --> 08:13.430
Little Red Riding Hood is me and the prince is Chiaki. Our imaginary kiss...

08:15.430 --> 08:16.470
What's wrong?

08:16.470 --> 08:18.260
Oh, n-nothing!

08:19.560 --> 08:25.230
Hey, you two! Let's go to Miyako's place and fix the dolls.

08:25.600 --> 08:26.940
Now?

08:26.940 --> 08:29.690
Yeah. What about you, Chiaki?

08:29.690 --> 08:30.940
It's okay with me.

08:31.990 --> 08:33.240
Then, let's go!

08:40.540 --> 08:43.660
Maron's late. What's she doing?

08:56.470 --> 09:01.140
It was her idea to fix the dolls.

09:01.140 --> 09:03.180
I-I'll go get her.

09:03.180 --> 09:03.850
Okay.

09:12.530 --> 09:13.650
Maron?

09:13.650 --> 09:15.240
Hey, Maron!

09:15.860 --> 09:17.450
Maron!!!

09:18.030 --> 09:19.200
Are you there?

09:20.200 --> 09:22.490
- Why aren't you going?

09:20.200 --> 09:22.490
- Maron!

09:22.490 --> 09:24.370
- It's okay.

09:24.370 --> 09:28.000
- Miyako, spend your time well with Chiaki.

09:25.580 --> 09:28.000
- Will you come out?

09:28.000 --> 09:29.880
- Oh, that's what it is!

09:28.750 --> 09:29.880
- Maron!

09:29.880 --> 09:32.840
- That's a weird reason not to go.

09:32.840 --> 09:35.380
- You don't have to understand.

09:33.550 --> 09:35.380
- Geez!

09:35.380 --> 09:37.180
Maron!

09:37.180 --> 09:39.010
Can't you hear me?

09:39.640 --> 09:40.890
Fine!

09:45.140 --> 09:46.980
Maron, where are you going?

09:54.190 --> 09:57.450
I... I have some business to take care of!

09:57.450 --> 09:59.070
What business?

09:59.070 --> 10:00.280
See ya!

10:00.280 --> 10:02.540
The two of you can finish up!

10:02.540 --> 10:05.410
The two of us?

10:05.410 --> 10:07.580
Oh, Maron...

10:07.580 --> 10:11.210
All right! I will get Chiaki today!

10:15.010 --> 10:16.130
Here goes...

10:18.300 --> 10:19.180
Where's Maron?

10:20.640 --> 10:25.560
She went out saying she had some business to take care of.

10:25.560 --> 10:26.930
Business?

10:26.930 --> 10:30.400
N...No idea what she was thinking!

10:32.560 --> 10:33.770
Um...

10:40.990 --> 10:43.490
Would you like some tea?

10:43.490 --> 10:44.870
Not now.

10:44.870 --> 10:48.290
Okay. Umm...

10:50.000 --> 10:53.340
Let's see...well...

10:56.170 --> 10:57.760
<i>I'm not doing very well.</i>

10:57.760 --> 10:58.670
What is it?

10:58.670 --> 11:04.390
Well, um... What do you think about the play that I wrote?

11:04.390 --> 11:06.770
About Little Red Riding Hood and the prince...

11:06.770 --> 11:10.190
...k-k-kissing?

11:11.350 --> 11:13.060
I think it's okay.

11:14.150 --> 11:16.400
Oh, I'm so glad!

11:17.230 --> 11:19.400
I thought so, too.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.160
Okay, I'm done!

11:24.160 --> 11:24.530
Huh?

11:24.530 --> 11:28.120
Here you go. Well, see ya. I'm hoing home now.

11:30.540 --> 11:31.540
It can't be...

11:34.840 --> 11:40.050
Damn it! That was my chance! Why did this have to happen?

11:44.390 --> 11:46.260
This is Keiichi's house?

11:46.260 --> 11:47.970
Look! It's his bike!

11:48.890 --> 11:50.270
It sure is.

11:50.270 --> 11:53.310
<i>Keiichi-kun is usually a very nice little boy.</i>

11:53.310 --> 11:56.690
<i>But he started acting up about a week ago...</i>

11:56.690 --> 12:02.490
<i>We're concerned that he and his parents may be having trouble...</i>

12:02.490 --> 12:05.780
<i>- I don't want to see your face anymore!</i>

12:07.200 --> 12:10.830
<i>Okay, then let's get a divorce.</i>

12:10.830 --> 12:12.830
<i>Anytime is fine.</i>

12:13.790 --> 12:16.170
What is it, Maron?

12:16.170 --> 12:18.710
Why are you so concerned about that little boy?

12:18.710 --> 12:21.010
- No! I don't want to!

12:21.010 --> 12:24.260
No, Mama! Stop it! I don't want to!

12:27.010 --> 12:28.720
The Petit Claire!

12:29.510 --> 12:31.980
You don't have to be in the house. Get out!

12:33.770 --> 12:36.520
Is Keiichi-kun's mother possessed by a Demon?

12:36.520 --> 12:38.270
Mama!

12:38.270 --> 12:42.610
Mama! Mama! Let me inside!

12:44.820 --> 12:46.070
Onee-chan!

12:47.030 --> 12:49.410
Being alone is sad...

12:51.290 --> 12:53.910
Notice

12:51.290 --> 12:53.910
Don't go away!

12:51.290 --> 12:53.910
I'll return right after these messages!

12:51.290 --> 12:53.910
Kaitou Jeanne

12:54.790 --> 12:57.380
Notice

12:54.790 --> 12:57.380
I'm back to continue my adventures

12:54.790 --> 12:57.380
Kaitou Jeanne

13:18.520 --> 13:20.320
What is this?!

13:21.570 --> 13:24.490
Your mom is just stressed out right now.

13:24.490 --> 13:29.320
But it's okay. I'll get your mom to return to normal.

13:29.320 --> 13:31.580
Really? Promise?

13:31.580 --> 13:33.790
Yes, it's a promise!

13:35.120 --> 13:37.040
Okay, go inside now.

13:37.040 --> 13:37.620
Okay.

13:39.790 --> 13:44.840
Maron! It's weird! The house is all messy, but there are no Demons around!

13:44.840 --> 13:47.180
That's odd. Did you search thoroughly?

13:47.180 --> 13:48.550
Maron!

13:48.550 --> 13:49.760
Really?

13:49.760 --> 13:53.310
Geez! Okay, this time I'll find it for sure!

13:59.270 --> 14:02.230
Maron, where did you go off to yesterday?

14:03.730 --> 14:05.990
Anyway, how was it with you and Chiaki?

14:05.990 --> 14:09.870
I found out that he's shyer than I thought.

14:09.870 --> 14:11.280
He is?

14:11.280 --> 14:14.410
Just watch! I'll get Chiaki's love sooner or later!

14:16.500 --> 14:17.290
Liar!

14:18.830 --> 14:20.130
Keiichi-kun!

14:20.130 --> 14:21.670
That boy from yesterday's...?

14:21.670 --> 14:26.630
You told me you'd get my mother back to normal. You liar!

14:26.630 --> 14:29.220
<i>His name is Keiichi-kun.</i>

14:29.220 --> 14:32.220
<i>His dad is the president of a construction company.</i>

14:32.220 --> 14:36.310
<i>But he is in the hospital because of an accident.</i>

14:36.310 --> 14:38.890
You found all of that out?

14:38.890 --> 14:43.440
Yeah, so his mother is in charge of the company while he's gone.

14:43.440 --> 14:47.900
So his mother is too busy and has no time for him.

14:47.900 --> 14:50.610
<i>Keiichi-kun, I'm not lying.</i>

14:50.610 --> 14:53.410
<i>I will help your mom.</i>

14:55.240 --> 14:56.500
Kusakabe.

14:56.500 --> 15:00.210
<i>- Fin, hurry up and find the Demon!</i>

14:57.080 --> 14:58.910
- Kusakabe.

15:00.210 --> 15:03.090
Hey, snap out of it!

15:03.090 --> 15:04.290
Huh?!

15:04.290 --> 15:05.800
KUSAKABE!

15:05.800 --> 15:06.800
Yes!

15:06.800 --> 15:09.510
How many times do you think I called your name?

15:09.510 --> 15:11.470
What is the answer to my question?

15:11.470 --> 15:14.510
Um, what was the question?

15:14.510 --> 15:15.720
Out!

15:37.620 --> 15:39.750
Kusakabe? Toudaiji?

15:40.370 --> 15:44.750
Both of you are participating in the next tournament.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.790
Really?!

15:45.790 --> 15:46.590
Yes.

15:46.590 --> 15:49.420
We're both in it! I'm so happy!

15:50.920 --> 15:52.380
Hurry up and get dressed!

15:52.380 --> 15:53.760
Yes, ma'am.

15:54.720 --> 15:56.050
I found it, Maron!

15:56.720 --> 16:00.230
I found out where the Demon is hiding!

16:00.230 --> 16:01.640
The notice card has already been sent!

16:02.060 --> 16:03.270
Let's go!

16:04.020 --> 16:04.980
Kusakabe?

16:04.980 --> 16:06.110
What the...?

16:08.110 --> 16:10.360
<i>A notice card arrived from Jeanne. - Fuyuta</i>

16:10.820 --> 16:12.070
What?!

16:12.450 --> 16:16.070
Where are you going?! Both of you, Out !!!

16:16.740 --> 16:18.330
You're already out...

16:27.540 --> 16:29.460
What a beautiful stone.

16:29.460 --> 16:31.800
It's my husband's treasure.

16:31.800 --> 16:33.090
Don't touch!

16:33.090 --> 16:35.550
How much do you think it cost?

16:35.550 --> 16:37.600
It's easily worth $300,000!

16:37.600 --> 16:38.390
I'm sorry.

16:38.760 --> 16:42.230
<i>"I will have the beauty of the stone."</i>

16:42.230 --> 16:45.190
Kaitou Jeanne's next target is this stone, huh?

16:46.360 --> 16:47.270
Jeanne?

16:49.230 --> 16:51.530
Try it if you dare.

16:51.530 --> 16:56.110
There are many things here, such as...

17:14.880 --> 17:16.550
This was a surprise.

17:16.550 --> 17:19.100
I never thought this kind of trap was out here.

17:19.100 --> 17:21.010
Isn't it a little dangerous?

17:21.010 --> 17:23.730
If it had fallen on us, we'd be flat as pancakes.

17:23.730 --> 17:26.940
You guys will have to watch out if you stay there!

17:32.900 --> 17:35.110
Mama, I'm hungry...

17:35.110 --> 17:39.160
Shut up! There should be some leftovers from yesterday.

17:39.160 --> 17:41.030
Prepare them yourself!

17:42.700 --> 17:44.870
What a harsh mother...

17:54.010 --> 17:55.220
Keiichi-kun...

17:55.220 --> 17:56.760
Go for it, Maron!

18:03.520 --> 18:04.680
Let's go!

18:08.190 --> 18:10.560
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

18:21.370 --> 18:22.780
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

18:22.780 --> 18:24.750
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

18:24.750 --> 18:26.580
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

18:31.750 --> 18:32.380
Jeanne!

18:33.460 --> 18:35.340
Jeanne's here!

18:41.090 --> 18:41.850
Take that!

18:41.850 --> 18:42.640
Jeanne!

18:43.720 --> 18:44.510
Ouch!

18:45.390 --> 18:46.390
What is this?

18:46.390 --> 18:49.350
Natsuda, wash your jacket once in awhile!

18:49.350 --> 18:50.350
S-Sorry...

18:55.690 --> 18:56.610
Who is it?

18:57.610 --> 19:00.910
Someone asked me to help out your mom.

19:02.820 --> 19:03.910
Just wait!

19:04.870 --> 19:07.830
So she didn't forget her promise to me!

19:18.010 --> 19:18.970
You're under arrest!

19:21.340 --> 19:22.550
She's headed towards the office!

19:26.970 --> 19:28.020
Now!

19:30.890 --> 19:32.400
You did it!

19:34.150 --> 19:35.860
My leg!

19:35.860 --> 19:37.150
- Jeanne fell!

19:37.150 --> 19:37.940
- Catch her!

19:38.740 --> 19:40.070
- Kaitou Jeanne.

19:43.280 --> 19:45.490
I don't think you'll make it this time.

19:45.490 --> 19:48.250
I can't stop now.

19:48.250 --> 19:50.540
I promised that boy.

19:50.540 --> 19:54.330
I can't stand anyone feeling sad because of a Demon!

20:02.010 --> 20:03.470
Yes, we did it! We did it!

20:03.470 --> 20:05.010
Way to go, Miyako-san!

20:05.010 --> 20:07.140
Jeanne, you're trapped like a rat!

20:09.220 --> 20:10.430
Why are you..?!

20:12.770 --> 20:14.350
I'll return the favor sometime!

20:15.020 --> 20:16.690
In the name of God...

20:17.900 --> 20:19.990
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:19.990 --> 20:22.200
I seal you here!

20:23.490 --> 20:24.950
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:33.540 --> 20:34.540
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:38.960 --> 20:40.260
I was...

20:41.470 --> 20:42.760
Keiichi?

20:46.600 --> 20:48.010
Mama!

20:55.980 --> 20:59.400
I see that you were able to keep your promise to that boy.

20:59.400 --> 21:00.530
Wait!

21:00.530 --> 21:02.740
You're always getting in my way.

21:02.740 --> 21:03.990
Why did you help me this time?

21:05.570 --> 21:06.870
'Cause I felt like it.

21:06.870 --> 21:09.280
I don't want to owe you anything!

21:09.280 --> 21:10.370
I'll pay you back now!

21:10.370 --> 21:11.790
What do you want me to do?

21:11.790 --> 21:14.620
You don't have to do anything.

21:14.620 --> 21:16.710
Tell me! What do you want me to do?

21:18.210 --> 21:19.960
You really will do anything?

21:19.960 --> 21:22.300
Don't make me say it again!

21:57.670 --> 21:59.670
I want you to...

21:59.670 --> 22:02.050
...stop being a Kaitou.

22:05.380 --> 22:11.220
For billions of years,

22:11.300 --> 22:20.770
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:22.940 --> 22:29.410
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.660 --> 22:35.700
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.330 --> 22:39.120
The huge mountains...

22:41.840 --> 22:48.760
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.260 --> 22:53.810
It took everything.

22:56.100 --> 23:02.020
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.110 --> 23:09.030
we watched the world ending...

23:09.240 --> 23:15.080
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.240 --> 23:24.880
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:31.340 --> 23:36.180
Wait a sec! What's that girl doing?! What's her relationship with Chiaki?!

23:36.180 --> 23:39.520
Isn't that Chiaki's fiancée, Sazanka Yashiro?

23:39.520 --> 23:43.100
What's thaaaaat?! Chiaki's fiancée?!

